  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela elili cheŋi chatama kumesu aYehova. Yehova wayiheni kudi aMidiyani nyaka yitanu nayiyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMidiyani ayimikili aIsarela mushindu; chaswejeluwu aMidiyani, anyana kaIsarela hiyakuloŋesha nimena ekala mumapidi, nimayeŋu, niyipaka yakudikaŋila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaneluwu aIsarela anadimi dehi, aMidiyani hiyakwinza, niaAmaleki, niantu akumusela, hinjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiya kuyi kamina hakatanda kalufu, akisaŋeni yakudya yamwituŋa yejima, nichiwukushika kuna kuGaza; mwituŋa daIsarela hiyashiyili mwoku yakudyaku, hela nyikoku, hela aŋombi, helayimbulu, yejima to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wena enjili nayimuna yawu namatenti awu, enjili amavulu neyi tubola, niwena nianŋameli jawu kutwesha kuyichindanehi. Enjili mwituŋa kulonda kudikisaŋana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela amwenikukala nankashi nawaMidiyani; anyana kaIsarela hiyakulemba kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaneluwu anyana kaIsarela hiyakulemba kudi Yehova hansaŋuya waMidiyani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuyitemeshela anyana kaIsarela kaprofwetu; yena wayilili nindi, Tiyenu chanahoshiyi Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela, nindi, Ami nayifumishili muEjipitu, nayifumishili mwitala dawuduŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naya mwini nikudi aEjipitu nikudi ejima ayikabishili, nayitemwininuwu kumesuenu, nayinkeli ituŋa dawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu nayilili nami, Ami yami Yehova Nzambiyenu; bayi mwakakamaŋa akishi awaAmori, akweti ituŋa dimwasha kamaku; hakwila enu kutiyilila mwizu dami nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wenjili, washakamini mwishina damukula wadiŋi muOfwara, waYowasha mukwaAbiyezeri. Mwanindi Gideyona hakuhulatidiku mwiyanda dakukamwina vinyu, kulonda asweki kuchina aMidiyani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova hakudimwekesha kudi yena, hakumwila nindi, Yehova wudi naneyi, eyi chilobu mukwaŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona wamwilili nindi, Eyi, Mwanta! Neyi Yehova tudi nindi, indi yuma yejima iyi yitukumona yinatuwani hanka? Indi yuma yakuhayamisha yejima yatulejeli atata jetu, yeliluwu nawu Yehova diyi watufumishili muEjipitu hiyidihi? Ichi dinu Yehova natúumbi dehi, natuhani dehi kudi aMidiyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumutala, hakumwila nindi, Yaŋa nayena Ŋovu yeyi oyu, kayamwini aIsarela kudi aMidiyani; nakutemeshi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka yena nindi, Eyi Mwanta, indi ami aIsarela nakayihandisha ŋahi? Chisaka chetu dichi chakuminamu hadi akwaManase, ninami aweni kumutaŋa watata yami ami yami kansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona weŋilili mwitala, watelekeli mwana kampembi, nimankendi akadi iluŋi achimpaya chawuŋa chimu. Mbŋi washili mwibaŋu, muzoŋuwashili mwinuŋu, hakutwala kwadiŋiyi mwishina damukula, yohana nikuhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaNzambi wamwilili nindi, Nonaku nimbiji nimankendi akadi iluŋi wutenteki helolidi, ichilaku muzoŋu. Dimu mweliliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wolweli mutondu wadiŋi kuchikasa chindi, wakunkiliinsa yawu kumbiji nikumankendi akadi iluŋi; mwilola mwakakumukili kesi, kanoŋesheli nimbiji nimankendi akadi iluŋi to-o. Kaŋelu kaYehova hakuyanikuya ŋamu, hamumweni cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona welukili nindi komanahikaŋelu kaYehova. Gideyona welili nindi, Yayo! Eyi Mwanta Nzambi! Namumona dehi kaŋelu kaYehova kumesu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili nindi, Kadiwundishi tuhu muchima weyi, bayi wutiya womaku, wukufwa wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona hakutuŋila Yehova kameŋa kwenoku, wakatumbili ijina nindi Yehova Shalomi. Nilelu kadi kwoku muOfwara wawaAbiyezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wufuku wowenawuna Yehova wamwilili nindi, Tambulaku ŋombiyatata yeyi, yoyi ŋombi yeyala yamuchiyedi yanyaka yitanu nayiyedi, kahumuni kameŋa kaBayali katata yeyi, katemi nimuyombu wuduku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "katuŋi kameŋa kaYehova Nzambi helolidi, mwomwatuŋilaŋawu tumeŋa; wakatambuliona ŋombi wamuchiyedi, wakamuketuli hichimuna wakushita mukesi, nchawa yiwukumwocha nachu yowu muyombu wakatema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona hadi aŋamba jindi wasendeli amayala ikumi, welili mwomwa mulejeliyi Yehova. Yena watiyili woma wamutaŋa watata yindi niwamayala amumukala, dichi hatwesheli kuchila namwaanaku, welili kwindi nawufuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala amumukala chahindukiluwu ntetemena yayeni nawu atali, ehe-e, kameŋa kaBayali mwaka ahumuna dehi, nimuyombu wadiŋuku mwakaawutema dehi, niŋombi yeyala yamuchiyedi amushita dehi hakameŋa kanatuŋuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiihwili muntu namukwawu, nawu, Indi wuneli chumichihinyi? Chehujoleluwu nakutonda, antu elili nawu, Gideyona mwana kaYowasha diyi neli chumichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutiya amayala amumukala hiyakumwila Yowasha, nawu, Idishaku mwaneyi, lelu wukufwa, muloŋa nahumuni kameŋa kaBayali, natemi dehi nimuyombu wadiŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowasha wayilili wejima wawu amwimeneni, nindi, Enu mumuhakwili Bayali? Ochumu mwamwini enu? Yowu wukumuhakwila diyi adi kujahawu, hohanuhachidi budidi. Neyi yena hiNzambi muleki adihakwili yomwenindina nichi chanamuhu mwinuwu kameŋa kindi kudi muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dodena ifuku odu anamutumbili ijina daYerubayali, nawu, Bayali adihakwili, amwinkikwindi muloŋa, nanochu chanamuhumwiniyi kameŋa kindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
