          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu niaMidiyani niaAmaleki niantu akumusela hiyakudipompesha; azambuka nikuzambuka, atuŋa nimuchinekineki chamuYezereyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Spiritu yaYehova wadivwikiliyi Gideyona niyena hakwimba mpùŋa; eniAbiyezeri amupompela nikumupompela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watemesheli antemesha muManase mwejima, niwena amupompela nikumupompela. Watemeshelini kuAsheri nikuZebuluni nikuNafwatali, niwena hiyakwinza nakuyikinkilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona hakumwila Nzambi, nindi, Neyi wukuyamwina aIsarela nachikasa chamami, muwunahoshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tala chitembi chamukoku ichinimavuji achu, nukuchisha heseki hakuhulila tidiku; neyi kukwila wilumikwahachitembi hohu hakwila heseki hejima hawuma chau, nukwiluka namiwakaya mwina aIsarela nachikasa chami, muwunahoshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili chochina. Yena wahindukili budidi, wakamwini chitembi, wakamwinumu wuumi, mbashila to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona wamwilili Nzambi, nindi, Bayi wunzuwilaku, nukuhosha aka kamu hohu, neseki kamu hohu mwani, nachitembi; ichidinu hakekali hawuma hohachitembi hohu, heseki hejima hakekali wuumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
